      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUCK SHINES (1) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led throughout to score when a 4 length winner (25.75) over 450m at this track. Expected to go well again. LEROY'S GIRL (7) after winning a Grade 5 two back missed the frame last time but not beaten far when a 1.5 lengths fifth (25.98) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. RAGING STORM (8) was always well back but did hit the line strongly late to finish 5th and beaten only 2 lengths (22.52) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. CINNABAR ICON (4) gave nothing else a chance most recently. Must be respected.",
